//@ test-compile-fail

// `differential` takes its expectation from the compile-time run, so it cannot be combined with an attribute that
// states a separate one, and it takes no value; every mistake is E0170 (spec/test-runner.md).
test "panic and differential" [differential, should_panic] { } //~ E0170
test "fail and differential" [differential, should_fail] { } //~ E0170
test "differential takes no value" [differential("strict")] { } //~ E0170
